{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Magical Girl Pretty Sammy","Sasami's always been kind of neat... but now she's been imbibed with a healthy dose of magic (which she plans to use to right the things wrong with the Earth, and, of course, help keep her brother Tenchi out of trouble). Naturally, there's going to be trouble: this time, it's the mysterious Pixy Misa... and Ryoko going at it against Ayeka (as usual) isn't making things any easier for her!\n\n\n(Source: AnimeNfo)"],"ja":["魔法少女プリティサミー",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-1918","ids":{"shikimori":1918,"mal":1918,"anilist":1918,"kodik":"serial-31133"},"kodikIds":["serial-27278","serial-31133"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-27278":"2020-06-30T11:48:13Z","serial-31133":"2020-12-27T20:55:05Z"},"title":"Девочка-волшебница Красотка Самми OVA","originalTitle":"Mahou Shoujo Pretty Sammy","alt":"Magical Girl Pretty Sammy Magical Girl Pretty Sammy 魔法少女プリティサミー","description":"Сасами Кавай всегда была довольно необычной девочкой... но теперь ей досталась изрядная доза магии, которую она планирует использовать, чтобы исправить непорядки на Земле и, конечно же, уберечь своего брата Тэнти Масаки от неприятностей. И неприятности не заставят себя ждать: на этот раз это загадочная Пикси Миса... а вечная грызня Рёко Хакуби с Аеко только всё усложняет!","year":1995,"type":"OVA","genres":["Комедия","махо седзе","пародия"],"rating":6.41,"popularity":2779,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/1918/f71edf0f2ecc7b7126d7ce768185bb78.jpeg","width":225,"height":350},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/ad9572be83affe60dba47b4021b0cfbec8445030.jpg","width":640,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-1050","dubId":"1050","label":"Akikomi","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"vali